<section class="h-[400px] relative flex items-center justify-center bg-primary-dark overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-dark via-primary to-primary-light opacity-80"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579684385127-1ef15d508118?q=80&w=2000&auto=format&fit=crop')] bg-cover bg-center mix-blend-overlay opacity-30"></div>
  <div class="relative z-10 text-center px-4 max-w-3xl">
    <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-accent/20 text-accent font-semibold text-sm rounded-full mb-4 border border-accent/30 tracking-wide uppercase">Naver Blog Sync</span>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight leading-tight">메이크닥 소식 & 입시 정보</h1>
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/80 font-medium leading-relaxed">최신 글로벌 해외 의대 입시 동향과 설명회 일정을 확인하세요.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Blog Feed Section -->
<section class="py-20 bg-bg-light relative">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-7xl">
    <!-- Filter/Search Bar -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center mb-12 gap-4">
      <div class="flex space-x-2">
        <button class="px-5 py-2 bg-primary text-white rounded-full text-sm font-semibold shadow-md transition-all hover:bg-primary-light">전체</button>
        <button class="px-5 py-2 bg-white text-text-muted border border-border shadow-sm rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-all hover:border-primary hover:text-primary">입시설명회</button>
        <button class="px-5 py-2 bg-white text-text-muted border border-border shadow-sm rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-all hover:border-primary hover:text-primary">합격현황</button>
      </div>
      <div class="relative w-full md:w-auto">
        <input type="text" placeholder="검색어를 입력하세요" class="w-full md:w-64 pl-10 pr-4 py-2 border border-border rounded-full text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-text-muted absolute left-4 top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path></svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Blog Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <a href="#" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 border border-border-light block">
        <div class="h-56 overflow-hidden relative">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544531586-fde5298cdd40?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" alt="Blog Thumb">
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 flex gap-2">
            <span class="bg-primary text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-lg">입시설명회</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8">
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-2 font-medium">2026. 04. 12</p>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-dark mb-3 line-clamp-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">2026 헝가리 의대/약대/수의대 진학 설명회 안내</h3>
          <p class="text-text-body text-sm line-clamp-3 mb-6 leading-relaxed">오는 4월 20일, 헝가리 국립 의대 진학을 위한 특별 설명회가 메이크닥 강남 본원에서 개최됩니다. 예비 신입생 여러분의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</p>
          <div class="flex items-center text-primary font-semibold text-sm">
            원문 보기 
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <a href="#" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 border border-border-light block">
        <div class="h-56 overflow-hidden relative">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581093450021-4a7360e9a6b5?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" alt="Blog Thumb">
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 flex gap-2">
            <span class="bg-accent text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-lg">합격현황</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8">
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-2 font-medium">2026. 03. 28</p>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-dark mb-3 line-clamp-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">[축하합니다!] Semmelweis University 합격 소식</h3>
          <p class="text-text-body text-sm line-clamp-3 mb-6 leading-relaxed">2026학년도 9월 학기 세멜바이스 의대에 메이크닥 수강생 15명이 최종 합격했습니다. 최선을 다한 학생들에게 큰 박수를 보냅니다.</p>
          <div class="flex items-center text-primary font-semibold text-sm">
            원문 보기 
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <a href="#" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 border border-border-light block">
        <div class="h-56 overflow-hidden relative">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary-dark"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1434030216411-0b793f4b4173?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop')] bg-cover bg-center mix-blend-overlay opacity-50 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"></div>
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 flex gap-2">
            <span class="bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/30 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-lg">동문인터뷰</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8">
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-2 font-medium">2026. 03. 15</p>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-dark mb-3 line-clamp-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">"의사의 꿈, 헝가리에서 이루다" 졸업생 인터뷰</h3>
          <p class="text-text-body text-sm line-clamp-3 mb-6 leading-relaxed">현지 적응부터 국가고시 준비까지, 데브레첸 의대를 우수한 성적으로 졸업한 선배의 리얼한 학교 생활기를 들어봅니다.</p>
          <div class="flex items-center text-primary font-semibold text-sm">
            원문 보기 
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      
      <!-- More cards would go here for presentation, omitting for brevity to show layout -->
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-16 text-center">
      <button class="px-8 py-3 border border-primary text-primary font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-all shadow-sm">더 많은 소식 보기</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
